WEBVTT

00:33.220 --> 00:36.680
<b>Please read the transmitter
operation manual thoroughly.</b>

00:37.770 --> 00:39.940
<b>The map I made is included.</b>

00:40.560 --> 00:44.980
<b>In emergencies we can communicate,
but do not count on being rescued.</b>

00:45.520 --> 00:47.400
<b>The underground is deep and vast</b>

00:47.530 --> 00:50.490
<b>so always keep track of
your current location.</b>

00:50.990 --> 00:53.620
<b>Losing your way in enemy territory
can be fatal.</b>

00:54.280 --> 00:55.410
<b>Please be careful.</b>

00:56.290 --> 01:00.710
<b>Hey. You're that super-fast hero,
Flashy Flash, right?</b>

01:01.120 --> 01:02.120
<b>Give me the boy.</b>

01:02.540 --> 01:03.920
<b>We've been waitin' for you.</b>

01:04.250 --> 01:07.920
<b>We already knew you were
coming in through this route.</b>

01:07.960 --> 01:10.340
<b>You boast about your speed</b>

01:10.380 --> 01:13.720
<b>but let's see if it works
in this narrow corridor.</b>

01:19.100 --> 01:21.020
<b>I've never bragged about my speed.</b>

01:21.020 --> 01:23.730
<b>That's the kind of thing
a side character would do.</b>

01:24.020 --> 01:26.690
<b>Though I do get told
I finish things quickly.</b>

02:57.030 --> 03:00.870
<b>NINJA TALE</b>

03:12.340 --> 03:13.460
<b>Impressive.</b>

03:14.630 --> 03:15.590
<b>Flashy...</b>

03:18.840 --> 03:19.930
<b>Well done.</b>

03:20.390 --> 03:22.100
<b>That's what makes you worth killing.</b>

03:22.260 --> 03:24.430
<b>Don't tell me that
was your top speed?</b>

03:24.770 --> 03:27.900
<b>You're the one responsible
for the Final 44 Incident.</b>

03:28.020 --> 03:29.900
<b>Flashy Flash.</b>

03:30.400 --> 03:31.440
<b>Oh, I see...</b>

03:40.030 --> 03:41.910
<b>So you were after me this whole time?</b>

03:42.120 --> 03:43.620
<b>Hmph. We finally meet.</b>

03:43.660 --> 03:44.910
<b>I’ve been waiting for this.</b>

03:45.370 --> 03:46.210
<b><i>This guy...</i></b>

03:46.830 --> 03:47.790
<b>Wind Blade Kick!</b>

03:50.790 --> 03:52.130
<b>Flame Blade Kick!</b>

03:55.590 --> 03:56.420
<b><i>Steel wire...!</i></b>

03:59.680 --> 04:00.930
<b><i>So close!</i></b>

04:01.220 --> 04:04.010
<b>I was this close to chopping you up
into little scraps of meat.</b>

04:04.270 --> 04:08.100
<b>I never expected you
to charge in alone like that.</b>

04:08.230 --> 04:10.150
<b>You must be pretty confident.</b>

04:10.190 --> 04:12.230
<b>Thanks to that,
things just got a lot easier for us.</b>

04:20.610 --> 04:21.780
<b>Enough of the chit-chat.</b>

04:21.990 --> 04:23.740
<b><i>Now, run for your life.</i></b>

04:24.030 --> 04:28.120
<b><i>Like an insect chased by wind and flame,</i>
<i>flying straight into the spider's web.</i></b>

04:28.330 --> 04:31.920
<b><i>You'll be shred into pieces</i>
<i>by your own speed!</i></b>

04:39.590 --> 04:41.180
<b>He cut away the walls.</b>

04:41.260 --> 04:42.850
<b>So, you're from the village, huh?</b>

04:42.930 --> 04:46.180
<b>And you joined the monsters
to take me down?</b>

04:46.390 --> 04:48.020
<b>Hmph. It's too cramped here.</b>

04:48.850 --> 04:50.140
<b>Let's move to another spot.</b>

05:08.200 --> 05:09.620
<b>Storm Blade Kick!</b>

05:21.930 --> 05:23.590
<b>Not a bad spot, huh?</b>

05:23.890 --> 05:26.720
<b>We took it by force
from the monsters.</b>

05:27.060 --> 05:29.180
<b>We can fight all we want here.</b>

05:29.480 --> 05:30.730
<b>And as hard as we want.</b>

05:31.440 --> 05:33.480
<b>The ones who will slay you are...</b>

05:33.520 --> 05:35.440
<b>From the Golden 37!</b>

05:35.860 --> 05:37.570
<b>Tempest Wind!</b>

05:36.230 --> 05:37.980
<b>THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
TEMPEST WIND</b>

05:39.940 --> 05:41.400
<b>And Hellfire Flame!</b>

05:40.440 --> 05:41.780
<b>THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
HELLFIRE FLAME</b>

06:06.470 --> 06:07.680
<b>Who hired you?</b>

06:07.810 --> 06:09.770
<b>After I finish off
the Monster Association</b>

06:09.770 --> 06:12.520
<b>I'll go pay a visit
to your employer.</b>

06:27.280 --> 06:29.450
<b>Our employer?</b>

06:31.870 --> 06:36.540
<b>What if I told you it's Skilfish
the King of Human Trafficking...</b>

06:37.130 --> 06:40.130
<b>Do you really expect to take on</b>

06:40.210 --> 06:43.010
<b>the army of his underworld
organization by yourself?</b>

06:43.670 --> 06:45.630
<b>- No.
- How come?</b>

06:45.800 --> 06:50.220
<b>Because I already killed him.
He kept sending assassins after me.</b>

06:51.720 --> 06:53.730
<b>What about Drug Shogun Heraud?</b>

06:53.890 --> 06:55.270
<b>Killed him too.</b>

06:55.310 --> 06:57.230
<b>Heart Collector Buligula?</b>

06:57.270 --> 06:58.110
<b>Finished him.</b>

06:58.150 --> 06:59.650
<b>Freak Phantom Thief Chimagusa?</b>

06:59.690 --> 07:00.520
<b>I took him out.</b>

07:00.520 --> 07:02.530
<b>Indomitable Bandit Captain Jamastorm?</b>

07:02.530 --> 07:04.150
<b>Oh yeah, I almost forgot about him.</b>

07:04.780 --> 07:07.740
<b>Assassination Alliance High Command?</b>

07:07.910 --> 07:09.700
<b>They're all at
the bottom of the ocean.</b>

07:10.370 --> 07:13.870
<b>I don't go around telling people,
so no one knows</b>

07:14.000 --> 07:17.040
<b>but I killed everyone who
came after me.</b>

07:17.960 --> 07:20.290
<b>Are you done with
all the loaded questions?</b>

07:20.540 --> 07:24.720
<b>So, who's really pulling
the strings behind the scenes?</b>

07:25.010 --> 07:30.720
<b>Those were the people we were
going to kill after finishing you off.</b>

07:30.760 --> 07:34.930
<b>But you've spared us the trouble.
So we're grateful.</b>

07:35.230 --> 07:37.730
<b>Thank you.
But you must now die!</b>

07:40.020 --> 07:41.150
<b>Compared to the heroes</b>

07:41.150 --> 07:43.780
<b>the top fighters from the village are
far more troublesome.</b>

07:45.820 --> 07:47.650
<b>Not all ninjas are from the village.</b>

07:47.780 --> 07:50.030
<b>But they're nothing compared
to ninjas from the village.</b>

07:50.160 --> 07:52.910
<b>Our generation from the village,
the Golden 37</b>

07:52.910 --> 07:54.580
<b>were hailed
as the strongest in history.</b>

07:54.660 --> 07:56.870
<b>We're the top two
of that generation.</b>

07:56.870 --> 07:58.370
<b>Let's see how long you'll last</b>

07:58.420 --> 08:00.380
<b>former number one
of the 44th generation!</b>

08:13.310 --> 08:14.180
<b>Not bad.</b>

08:14.260 --> 08:16.020
<b>Was that your top speed?</b>

08:16.140 --> 08:17.640
<b>Stop holding back.</b>

08:17.640 --> 08:19.650
<b>Why don't you just
unleash it already?</b>

08:20.150 --> 08:22.060
<b>That monster power of yours.</b>

08:22.480 --> 08:24.270
<b>Hmph. So you knew.</b>

08:24.440 --> 08:27.690
<b>I had a strange feeling
when we first fought</b>

08:27.690 --> 08:30.820
<b>but I knew for sure when you
wanted to move the fight elsewhere.</b>

08:31.200 --> 08:33.830
<b>You only recently became monsters</b>

08:33.830 --> 08:36.580
<b>so you're not used
to your top speeds yet.</b>

08:36.870 --> 08:39.580
<b>So you lured me into
this open space.</b>

08:39.750 --> 08:43.250
<b>Well, well. So you knew,
and still took the bait?</b>

08:43.420 --> 08:46.760
<b>You're one cocky bastard.
Show some respect to your seniors!</b>

08:47.050 --> 08:50.220
<b>Right back at you.
I'll teach you lowlifes a lesson.</b>

08:50.340 --> 08:54.390
<b>Turning into monsters doesn't
mean you can surpass me.</b>

08:54.510 --> 08:57.930
<b>Those words...
you can't take them back now.</b>

08:54.890 --> 08:57.930
<b>THREAT LEVEL: DRAGON
HELLFIRE FLAME/TEMPEST WIND</b>

08:58.310 --> 09:00.850
<b>From here on, don't look away.</b>

09:15.990 --> 09:17.870
<b>Fireburst Scatterflash Slash.</b>

09:22.790 --> 09:25.130
<b><i>He withstood my monster swordplay?</i></b>

09:25.210 --> 09:26.590
<b><i>Or was it just luck? No...</i></b>

09:28.920 --> 09:30.050
<b>Heavy Flash Slash.</b>

09:33.930 --> 09:35.390
<b>Your aim was to destroy
my weapon?!</b>

09:35.510 --> 09:37.930
<b>Too slow. Your brain can’t keep up,
you're useless.</b>

09:41.140 --> 09:44.230
<b>I can see why they say
he's a genius, just like us.</b>

09:44.480 --> 09:48.940
<b>In terms of technical precision,
Flash might have the edge.</b>

09:49.230 --> 09:53.160
<b>He shows no sign of having
a disadvantage in speed or power.</b>

09:53.450 --> 09:57.280
<b>No monsters other than us
would stand a chance against him...</b>

09:57.280 --> 09:59.200
<b>Still think you outclass me?</b>

09:59.330 --> 10:00.660
<b>You don't.</b>

10:02.410 --> 10:05.710
<b>Tempest Wind, Hellfire Flame...</b>

10:05.710 --> 10:08.420
<b>I know your moves inside and out.</b>

10:09.340 --> 10:13.260
<b>After all, I've trained harder
than anyone.</b>

10:13.720 --> 10:17.550
<b>The more skilled a fighter is, the less
they deviate from the fundamentals.</b>

10:17.890 --> 10:19.260
<b>No matter how fast the attack</b>

10:19.350 --> 10:22.810
<b>if you know the fundamentals,
you can deal with it easily.</b>

10:23.890 --> 10:26.230
<b>Hmph. All right.</b>

10:26.650 --> 10:28.110
<b>That's enough...right?</b>

10:28.230 --> 10:31.820
<b>Yeah, that's enough.
I'm done fighting as a ninja.</b>

10:32.070 --> 10:33.950
<b>No more technique or weapons.</b>

10:34.070 --> 10:36.370
<b>We'll kill you as monsters.</b>

10:36.490 --> 10:39.990
<b>That will be the most brutal
and violent way.</b>

10:40.200 --> 10:42.910
<b>What you are about
to witness will simply be...</b>

10:43.040 --> 10:47.880
<b>Both of us pulverizing a weakling
with our overwhelming speed.</b>

10:48.130 --> 10:52.010
<b>You forced us to abandon
our last shred of pride as ninjas.</b>

10:52.010 --> 10:56.220
<b>Out of respect, we'll unleash
our maximum speed and</b>

10:56.260 --> 10:58.970
<b>attack you relentlessly
until you're dead.</b>

10:59.220 --> 11:02.890
<b>Learn what separates
humans from monsters, and die.</b>

11:03.060 --> 11:05.730
<b>Farewell. Flashy Flash.</b>

11:24.500 --> 11:26.830
<b>You think you can get away
from me now?</b>

11:26.960 --> 11:29.000
<b>Do not disappoint me.</b>

11:52.150 --> 11:53.440
<b>Flashy Kick!</b>

11:56.280 --> 11:58.030
<b><i>This is bad, he's closing in.</i></b>

11:58.200 --> 12:00.120
<b><i>We need to get</i>
<i>our footing back quickly.</i></b>

12:03.700 --> 12:04.620
<b>Absolute technique.</b>

12:09.500 --> 12:10.960
<b>Flashy Slash.</b>

12:20.300 --> 12:22.720
<b>Damn it. How irritating.</b>

12:23.180 --> 12:26.730
<b>He had that secret technique all along,
and didn't use it until now.</b>

12:27.390 --> 12:31.060
<b>I was just waiting for the right moment
to take you both down.</b>

12:31.350 --> 12:36.530
<b>If even one of you escaped,
it would've been troublesome later.</b>

12:40.570 --> 12:42.240
<b>None of the other Class-S heroes</b>

12:42.240 --> 12:46.160
<b>would've been able to keep up
with your speed.</b>

12:46.450 --> 12:51.540
<b>Your best move was simply
not to fight me at all.</b>

12:51.920 --> 12:55.050
<b>If only my opponent weren't you...</b>

12:56.510 --> 12:58.630
<b>You really get under my skin.</b>

12:59.010 --> 13:01.430
<b>Assassins live in the shadows.</b>

13:01.550 --> 13:05.220
<b>We're never treated as people.
Only used and discarded.</b>

13:06.180 --> 13:11.190
<b>We just wanted to be the ones
in control...to rule for once.</b>

13:12.020 --> 13:13.520
<b>To gain power...</b>

13:13.650 --> 13:16.270
<b>we tried everything we could think of...</b>

13:16.780 --> 13:18.570
<b>Flashy Flash...</b>

13:19.030 --> 13:22.320
<b>What was it that we lacked?</b>

13:39.380 --> 13:41.170
<b>Not enough training.</b>

13:53.810 --> 13:55.150
<b>Where am I?</b>

13:55.440 --> 13:57.610
<b>I should check my current position.</b>

13:57.690 --> 13:58.820
<b>RUMMAGING</b>

13:59.900 --> 14:00.940
<b>SPEEDY</b>

14:03.660 --> 14:04.910
<b>WHOOSH</b>

14:05.700 --> 14:09.330
<b>The one moving around at
high speed must have been Flash.</b>

14:09.700 --> 14:13.080
<b>But then he stopped.
Is his transmitter broken?</b>

14:13.830 --> 14:16.210
<b><i>There's no unusual movements</i>
<i>from the others.</i></b>

14:17.040 --> 14:19.880
<b><i>But even if anything happens,</i>
<i>they can handle it.</i></b>

14:20.170 --> 14:21.420
<b><i>And if they're truly in danger,</i></b>

14:21.420 --> 14:23.680
<b><i>I'm sure they'll send</i>
<i>a distress signal.</i></b>

14:24.890 --> 14:27.720
<b><i>They're not the ones</i>
<i>I'm worried about.</i></b>

14:28.260 --> 14:30.180
<b><i>If we can somehow</i>
<i>rescue the hostage</i></b>

14:30.220 --> 14:34.100
<b><i>the mental strain of this battle</i>
<i>will be greatly reduced.</i></b>

14:35.270 --> 14:38.900
<b><i>I need to do what I can</i>
<i>so they can go all out.</i></b>

14:39.400 --> 14:42.820
<b><i>I kept quiet to avoid stirring things up,</i>
<i>but I have some intel.</i></b>

14:46.070 --> 14:47.370
<b>MINI OCTO-TANK NO. 8</b>

14:48.410 --> 14:49.240
<b><i>I'm close!</i></b>

14:54.040 --> 14:55.000
<b><i>Unbelievable...</i></b>

14:55.790 --> 14:59.130
<b><i>Knight did extreme durability testing,</i>
<i>but he's in this state.</i></b>

14:59.630 --> 15:02.550
<b><i>Apparently Monster King Orochi</i>
<i>did this to him.</i></b>

15:02.670 --> 15:05.470
<b><i>What kind of attack</i>
<i>destroyed him to this extent?</i></b>

15:05.840 --> 15:07.760
<b><i>Oh god, I hope I never run into him.</i></b>

15:09.300 --> 15:13.890
<b><i>Since he won't tell me, I'll just</i>
<i>extract the data from the robot.</i></b>

15:14.810 --> 15:16.310
<b>Any data will do.</b>

15:16.440 --> 15:19.520
<b>As long as there's a clue that'll
lead me to the hostage's location.</b>

15:21.230 --> 15:25.110
<b>There's evidence someone
tried to reassemble it.</b>

15:25.740 --> 15:30.740
<b>Some parts show no damage at all
and are neatly disassembled.</b>

15:30.910 --> 15:34.200
<b>Do they have an expert
in this field?</b>

15:34.580 --> 15:38.880
<b>If the monsters use our own technology
against us, we're in serious trouble.</b>

15:39.000 --> 15:41.590
<b>Ugh, another headache...</b>

15:42.500 --> 15:44.760
<b>I found it!! This is...</b>

15:45.420 --> 15:50.300
<b><i>The radar already mapped the</i>
<i>correct route to the hostage's location!</i></b>

15:50.850 --> 15:54.270
<b><i>He knew this the whole time,</i>
<i>but still refused to cooperate...</i></b>

15:54.560 --> 15:57.890
<b><i>Oh well,</i>
<i>getting angry won't help now.</i></b>

15:58.940 --> 16:02.690
<b><i>We finally found the right lead.</i>
<i>We gotta stay positive!</i></b>

16:03.270 --> 16:05.110
<b><i>I know the hostage's location.</i></b>

16:05.490 --> 16:09.700
<b><i>Taking steady, small steps is</i>
<i>the shortcut to success.</i></b>

16:10.370 --> 16:12.620
<b><i>You can't think straight</i>
<i>when you're irritated.</i></b>

16:12.780 --> 16:15.410
<b><i>I'm having some sugar</i>
<i>to give my brain a break.</i></b>

16:18.790 --> 16:20.630
<b>Did you make that?</b>

16:20.750 --> 16:22.380
<b>What a childish design.</b>

16:22.630 --> 16:25.670
<b>I bet you came here to
have fun, didn't you?</b>

16:26.300 --> 16:28.840
<b>It must be nice being a kid
and having no worries.</b>

16:29.260 --> 16:32.850
<b>But I show no mercy,
even to children.</b>

16:34.470 --> 16:35.560
<b>Are you one of the leaders?</b>

16:36.140 --> 16:39.100
<b>I'm what you'd call
a middle manager.</b>

16:39.560 --> 16:43.020
<b>Not exactly in the leadership,
but still respected by those around me.</b>

16:43.110 --> 16:45.570
<b>In a way, even more capable
than some of the bosses.</b>

16:46.740 --> 16:51.280
<b>Got it? Organizations have
all kinds of constraints.</b>

16:51.610 --> 16:56.490
<b>That's probably a tough concept
for a kid who just idolizes heroes.</b>

16:57.080 --> 17:02.000
<b>A clever kid gets promoted
to Class-S and becomes famous</b>

17:02.040 --> 17:03.630
<b>then gets spoiled rotten.</b>

17:03.750 --> 17:08.010
<b>Now his arrogance will be
his end. How tragic.</b>

17:08.920 --> 17:12.720
<b>You shouldn't have taken the praise
from adults too seriously.</b>

17:14.220 --> 17:17.180
<b>I only trust myself.</b>

17:17.270 --> 17:20.890
<b>This Monster Association is
just a stepping stone.</b>

17:21.270 --> 17:25.070
<b>Eventually, I'll take the title
of king from Orochi.</b>

17:25.820 --> 17:32.610
<b>THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
PHOENIX MAN</b>

17:25.820 --> 17:27.730
<b>I'm Phoenix Man.</b>

17:28.190 --> 17:29.940
<b>I couldn't take off this bird costume</b>

17:29.990 --> 17:32.610
<b>and before I knew it,
I'd become a monster.</b>

17:32.950 --> 17:35.280
<b>Child Emperor...
You are a victim of the times.</b>

17:35.280 --> 17:36.830
<b>This is where you die.</b>

17:36.950 --> 17:39.660
<b>I'll give you an instant death
so you won't suffer.</b>

17:39.750 --> 17:40.910
<b>Beak Attack!</b>

17:42.500 --> 17:46.540
<b>While you were talking,
I fired out wires and set this up.</b>

17:47.170 --> 17:52.340
<b>This thin transparent film
is resistant to sudden impact.</b>

17:53.220 --> 17:55.350
<b>You can roll it up into a tube
and carry it around.</b>

17:55.470 --> 17:57.600
<b>You can even wrap candy with it.
Handy, isn't it?</b>

17:58.770 --> 18:00.520
<b>I'll name it "Invisible Wall."</b>

18:00.930 --> 18:04.350
<b>Too bland?
Maybe "Irritating Shield" is better.</b>

18:05.110 --> 18:07.770
<b>I thought I could have a
decent conversation with you.</b>

18:07.860 --> 18:11.400
<b>I considered taking you alive
and using you as my guide...</b>

18:11.820 --> 18:13.860
<b>But right now,
I'm in a bad mood.</b>

18:20.200 --> 18:23.500
<b>Ambition is fine,
but if you were truly talented</b>

18:23.500 --> 18:26.210
<b>you wouldn't have joined
the Monster Association.</b>

18:27.630 --> 18:29.340
<b>I guess the same goes for me.</b>

18:29.630 --> 18:32.170
<b>Thanks.
I feel a bit calmer now.</b>

18:43.230 --> 18:44.600
<b>Hey, shut up.</b>

18:44.690 --> 18:45.520
<b>What's the problem?</b>

18:45.600 --> 18:47.150
<b>The kid's making a fuss.</b>

18:47.270 --> 18:49.690
<b>What a pain in the butt.
Should we just eat him?</b>

18:49.860 --> 18:52.740
<b>The heroes have already broken in.</b>

18:52.860 --> 18:55.410
<b>Who cares about the well-being
of the hostages?</b>

18:55.530 --> 18:56.360
<b>I like that.</b>

18:56.820 --> 18:58.830
<b>Hm? What's this?</b>

18:59.280 --> 19:00.830
<b>- Huh?
- Huh?</b>

19:00.950 --> 19:02.000
<b>- Huh?
- Oh.</b>

19:02.290 --> 19:03.710
<b>Crap! Don't breathe it in!</b>

19:11.460 --> 19:12.840
<b><i>- Waganma?</i>
- Huh?</b>

19:14.260 --> 19:16.630
<b><i>I'm here to rescue you.</i>
<i>Come on, let's get outta here.</i></b>

19:19.140 --> 19:20.470
<b>Hedro Press!</b>

19:21.140 --> 19:23.850
<b>THREAT LEVEL: TIGER
HEDRO-JELLYFISH</b>

19:25.810 --> 19:28.100
<b>So some monsters
aren’t affected by poison gas?</b>

19:35.280 --> 19:37.570
<b>Maybe you're not as tough
as I thought?</b>

19:37.780 --> 19:39.320
<b><i>Even cutting has no effect.</i></b>

19:41.120 --> 19:43.040
<b>Aaargh...</b>

19:43.160 --> 19:44.540
<b>Just kidding!</b>

19:44.660 --> 19:47.960
<b>I'm telling you, cutting or
stabbing won't do a thing.</b>

19:49.170 --> 19:51.960
<b>I see you don't have
a way to kill me.</b>

19:52.130 --> 19:53.840
<b>My luck has finally turned!</b>

19:53.920 --> 19:56.930
<b>Who would've thought taking a
Class-S hero's head would be this easy?</b>

19:59.720 --> 20:00.600
<b>What the...?</b>

20:00.760 --> 20:01.720
<b><i>It's fuel oil.</i></b>

20:05.770 --> 20:07.480
<b><i>That reeks.</i>
<i>Let's get outta here.</i></b>

20:07.560 --> 20:08.440
<b>O-Okay.</b>

20:14.400 --> 20:16.490
<b>You can take off the Ribbit Mask now.</b>

20:16.610 --> 20:17.610
<b>How do you feel?</b>

20:19.360 --> 20:21.320
<b>Uh...I'm starving.</b>

20:22.990 --> 20:25.080
<b>You're the Class-S hero,
Child Emperor, right?</b>

20:25.200 --> 20:26.960
<b>What took you so long? Geez!</b>

20:27.870 --> 20:29.290
<b>Oops, sorry, sorry.</b>

20:29.960 --> 20:30.790
<b>Get behind me.</b>

20:30.830 --> 20:32.500
<b>- Huh?
- There's still something out there.</b>

20:34.380 --> 20:36.760
<b>I'll take it out with my
remote-control tank, then we move.</b>

20:37.380 --> 20:38.630
<b>That looks fun.</b>

20:47.680 --> 20:48.890
<b>You're a hero.</b>

20:49.230 --> 20:52.400
<b>Spare me your name.
I'll dispose of you right away.</b>

20:53.690 --> 20:55.650
<b><i>A machine?!</i>
<i>In that case...</i></b>

21:01.160 --> 21:03.780
<b>A mechanical opponent neutralizer.
Bug Ba-Zapper!</b>

21:07.370 --> 21:09.580
<b>Contains them in a high-voltage cage</b>

21:09.660 --> 21:11.790
<b>then overloads them with signals
to shut them down.</b>

21:11.920 --> 21:14.460
<b>Nice! I wanna take that robot home.</b>

21:18.260 --> 21:19.130
<b>What?</b>

21:19.970 --> 21:21.010
<b><i>He's tough!</i></b>

21:21.470 --> 21:22.720
<b>Waganma, stay back!</b>

21:23.510 --> 21:26.680
<b>Damn it. I'm burning through items fast,
but it can't be helped.</b>

21:26.970 --> 21:27.890
<b>Come out!</b>

21:30.020 --> 21:31.690
<b>Faithful Servants Underdog Men!</b>

21:31.980 --> 21:34.360
<b>No. 23. No. 24. No. 25!!</b>

21:34.650 --> 21:35.520
<b>Combine!</b>

21:40.530 --> 21:42.320
<b>Mad Underdog Cerberus!</b>

21:42.740 --> 21:44.030
<b>That looks fierce.</b>

21:44.070 --> 21:46.330
<b>Awesome! It's a robot fight.</b>

21:46.410 --> 21:47.660
<b>Uh, yeah.</b>

21:49.950 --> 21:51.660
<b>How dare you put me
in the same class</b>

21:51.660 --> 21:53.830
<b>as dog-level artificial intelligence.</b>

21:55.630 --> 21:56.710
<b>Pencil Missile!</b>

21:58.880 --> 21:59.960
<b>Birdlime Warhead!</b>

22:02.090 --> 22:04.340
<b>Wild Dogpaddle Punch!</b>

22:04.760 --> 22:06.640
<b>Yeah, go for it!</b>

22:06.890 --> 22:08.220
<b>Let's get outta here, Waganma.</b>

22:08.260 --> 22:09.100
<b>Hm?</b>

22:09.140 --> 22:10.180
<b>Come on, hurry up.</b>

22:10.220 --> 22:12.140
<b>W-Wait... How come...?</b>

22:17.480 --> 22:19.230
<b><i>Don't get distracted.</i></b>

22:19.570 --> 22:22.990
<b><i>Right now, I need to focus on getting</i>
<i>Waganma out of harm's way.</i></b>

23:56.040 --> 24:00.880
<b>BRAVE CHILD</b>
